  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pj3:5.23.1": "The text doesn’t say what the legal procedure, the <i lang='pi' translate='no'>(saṅgha-)kamma</i>, was about, but it seems implied that it was against that monk. This is also the position of the sub-commentary at Sp-ṭ 1.187: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Kammādhippāyāti tajjanīyādikammakaraṇādhippāyā</i>, “Aiming at a legal procedure: aiming at doing a legal procedure of censure, etc.” The monks from the group of seventeen were in regular conflict with the monks from the group of six. ",
